sequenceDiagram
    actor Caller as Internal caller
    participant Command as Command model
    participant CR as Command repository
    participant Execution as Execution snapshot
    participant ER as Execution repository

    Caller->>Command: create command
    Command->>Command: validate metadata and payload
    alt Invalid command
        Command-->>Caller: validation exception
    else Valid command
        Command-->>Caller: UavCommand
        Caller->>CR: save(command)
        CR-->>Caller: stored command
        opt Record current execution status
            Caller->>Execution: create(command, status, context)
            Execution-->>Caller: immutable snapshot
            Caller->>ER: save(snapshot)
            alt First or non-older update
                ER-->>Caller: stored snapshot
            else Changed command or older update
                ER-->>Caller: IllegalArgumentException
            end
        end
    end
    Note over Caller,ER: No external receipt, UAV dispatch, ACK, result, retry, or timeout workflow exists yet.
